t>] BesselI[nu_l, y_l t<]. lines lists the vertex pairs {v, w} of a tree on \
the vertices 1, ..., Length[r]; nu lists the Bessel orders. Each result is an \
association: \\\"Integrand\\\" (the MB, for MBEvaluate), \\\"Variables\\\" \
(the MB variables in the energies), \\\"Prefactor\\\", \\\"Later\\\" (the \
later vertex of each line), \\\"Push\\\" and \\\"Base\\\"; the integral is \
the sum over the orientations of Prefactor times the integrand's value. \
