Cell["\<\
The Subtraction method reaches \[Epsilon]^5, where the coefficient is of \
weight up to eight. Besides products of zeta values, it contains the \
irreducible constant of weight eight HPLs8a of the HPL package, which \
corresponds to the multiple zeta value \[Zeta](5,3).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cc0bec60-b0a3-4c7d-bb72-203b7b366fe5"],

