Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2-Denominator Massless Angular Integral", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"90aeb73d-6115-4a1b-a183-d0d32bc420f8"],

Cell["\<\
This example is the angular integral of two massless denominators, discussed \
in Section 6.2 of our paper, with the powers j_1 = j_2 = 1 and the \
normalisation I = 2^(-1 + 2 \[Epsilon]) \[Pi]^\[Epsilon] \[CapitalGamma](1 - \
2 \[Epsilon])/\[CapitalGamma](1 - \[Epsilon]) \[CapitalOmega]. The variable \
v12 is a kinematic variable in 0 < v12 < 1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eed8b5a4-88b9-4df4-8f64-ae11dce8403d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Configuration", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"24ea49aa-8fe6-476e-a0e3-7ae036235f41"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"I11", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"2", "^", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Epsilon]"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Pi", "^", "\[Epsilon]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Gamma", "[", 
