The coefficient of \[Epsilon]^3 at x = (-1/5, -1/7, -1/9) agrees with \
MultiHypExp (Section 6.5 of our paper).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b743bef8-85cb-4dfa-844d-84aeb976f9cc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"resT3", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"MBEvaluate", "[", 
    RowBox[{"T3", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"u1", ",", " ", "u2", ",", " ", "u3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<SymbolicSum\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"NG", "[", 
