The three coefficients agree with the expansion at this point given in \
Section 6.4 of our paper and with SubTropica.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"66126ae7-ce72-474a-8ed9-8c0b3b05806e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Tc", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"b", "[", "\"\<Prefactor\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
