Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Closed Form", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"3d00f527-e731-409f-95f6-4bb4f0885b77"],

Cell["\<\
The closed forms of the coefficients of A through \[Delta]^2, as functions of \
k1, k2 and k3, assembled from the Subtraction results of the nine MB \
integrals, are stored in the following cell, as an association from the order \
of \[Delta] to its coefficient.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c56bdaab-ec7b-403c-919d-423dfb1fe133"],

