Cell["\<\
The coefficient of \[Epsilon]^-3 is a lengthy combination of MPLs whose \
letters contain the square root of u(4 - u). Its value at u = 1/3 agrees with \
the numerical integration of MB.m given in Section 6.5 of our paper, \
-931.7858(8).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f14d059f-0e16-447e-9350-bed4698491ec"],

